  "courseSlug": "nextjs-react-the-complete-guide",
  "courseTitle": "Next.js & React - The Complete Guide",
  "sourceLanguage": "en",
  "targetLanguage": "zh-TW",
  "lectures": [
    {
      "id": "43340680",
      "title": "Combining Parallel & Intercepting Routes",
      "lectureOrder": 149,
      "videoOrder": 139,
      "sourceHash": "d53adba256007ebc1195cb1a61d4e7ca9e13dabc3729fe2e169b78ecf2ea9c8c",
      "cues": [
        {
          "id": 1,
          "start": 1.11,
          "end": 3.84,
          "en": "So to make this intercepted page",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 2,
          "start": 3.84,
          "end": 5.25,
          "en": "a bit more useful,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 3,
          "start": 5.25,
          "end": 8.43,
          "en": "I will actually get rid of this h2 element,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 4,
          "start": 8.43,
          "end": 12.63,
          "en": "and instead, my idea now is to either show this here,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 5,
          "start": 12.63,
          "end": 15.33,
          "en": "in this intercepted page as a modal,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 6,
          "start": 15.33,
          "end": 18.18,
          "en": "or to show it as a regular full screen page,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 7,
          "start": 18.18,
          "end": 21.06,
          "en": "depending on how we got to this page.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 8,
          "start": 21.06,
          "end": 23.7,
          "en": "Therefore, I'll start by adding some markup here",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 9,
          "start": 23.7,
          "end": 27.33,
          "en": "to the intercepted route page.js file.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 10,
          "start": 27.33,
          "end": 29.73,
          "en": "I'll bring back that fragment.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 11,
          "start": 29.73,
          "end": 32.25,
          "en": "And then in there I wanna have a div",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 12,
          "start": 32.25,
          "end": 36.597,
          "en": "with a className of \"modal-backdrop\",",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 13,
          "start": 37.5,
          "end": 39.9,
          "en": "which will render a backdrop behind the modal",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 14,
          "start": 39.9,
          "end": 43.39,
          "en": "and then wrap the main content into a dialog",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 15,
          "start": 44.37,
          "end": 47.637,
          "en": "on which I'll add a className of \"modal\".",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 16,
          "start": 48.75,
          "end": 50.733,
          "en": "And I'll then add the open prop here.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 17,
          "start": 51.6,
          "end": 54.09,
          "en": "With that done, if we save that,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 18,
          "start": 54.09,
          "end": 55.74,
          "en": "you'll see that if you reload,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 19,
          "start": 55.74,
          "end": 58.14,
          "en": "you still have that full screen page.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 20,
          "start": 58.14,
          "end": 60.39,
          "en": "But if you get there by clicking,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 21,
          "start": 60.39,
          "end": 63.633,
          "en": "it's shown as such a modal dialog instead.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 22,
          "start": 64.86,
          "end": 67.65,
          "en": "However, it's not really shown as an overlay",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 23,
          "start": 67.65,
          "end": 69.33,
          "en": "to the rest of the page.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 24,
          "start": 69.33,
          "end": 71.37,
          "en": "As you can see, if you take a close look",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 25,
          "start": 71.37,
          "end": 73.83,
          "en": "at the part behind the modal,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 26,
          "start": 73.83,
          "end": 78.06,
          "en": "there's nothing there because it's still a page",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 27,
          "start": 78.06,
          "end": 80.07,
          "en": "that takes up all the available space",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 28,
          "start": 80.07,
          "end": 82.41,
          "en": "in its surrounding layout.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 29,
          "start": 82.41,
          "end": 84.69,
          "en": "Therefore, to make it an overlay",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 30,
          "start": 84.69,
          "end": 88.14,
          "en": "over the page we're coming from,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 31,
          "start": 88.14,
          "end": 90.63,
          "en": "we can use a shared layout",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 32,
          "start": 90.63,
          "end": 94.503,
          "en": "and this parallel routing feature you learned about earlier.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 33,
          "start": 95.34,
          "end": 100.34,
          "en": "So here in our case, we can set up a layout.js file",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 34,
          "start": 100.83,
          "end": 102.84,
          "en": "next to the page.js file",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 35,
          "start": 102.84,
          "end": 106.203,
          "en": "that shows the details for a selected news article,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 36,
          "start": 107.7,
          "end": 110.82,
          "en": "and name that function here,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 37,
          "start": 110.82,
          "end": 114.15299999999999,
          "en": "NewsDetailLayout or something like this.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 38,
          "start": 115.62,
          "end": 118.5,
          "en": "And then there we'll get the children prop,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 39,
          "start": 118.5,
          "end": 122.34,
          "en": "which will hold the content of the currently active page.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 40,
          "start": 122.34,
          "end": 125.4,
          "en": "So here all then I'll put a fragment",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 41,
          "start": 125.4,
          "end": 129.723,
          "en": "and inside of that fragment output my children prop value.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 42,
          "start": 130.83,
          "end": 134.34,
          "en": "But now I wanna set up parallel routing here",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 43,
          "start": 134.34,
          "end": 137.94,
          "en": "with two routes that are shown in parallel,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 44,
          "start": 137.94,
          "end": 141.63,
          "en": "where one route is the standard news item detail page,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 45,
          "start": 141.63,
          "end": 144.75,
          "en": "and the other route is this modal overlay,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 46,
          "start": 144.75,
          "end": 147.723,
          "en": "which is not always shown of course, but sometimes.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 47,
          "start": 148.74,
          "end": 152.52,
          "en": "Therefore, we could add two sibling folders here.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 48,
          "start": 152.52,
          "end": 155.1,
          "en": "One may be named @modal,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 49,
          "start": 155.1,
          "end": 157.05,
          "en": "and then next to it one other",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 50,
          "start": 157.05,
          "end": 161.82,
          "en": "which we could name @default or details or whatever.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 51,
          "start": 161.82,
          "end": 165.48,
          "en": "And then we could move that page.js file here,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 52,
          "start": 165.48,
          "end": 167.97,
          "en": "which shows us the details about an article",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 53,
          "start": 167.97,
          "end": 170.973,
          "en": "into this details folder.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 54,
          "start": 172.05,
          "end": 173.61,
          "en": "But since I always wanna show",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 55,
          "start": 173.61,
          "end": 176.19,
          "en": "that there actually is something else you can do",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 56,
          "start": 176.19,
          "end": 178.74,
          "en": "when working with parallel routes,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 57,
          "start": 178.74,
          "end": 182.34,
          "en": "instead of moving it into a separate parallel route folder,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 58,
          "start": 182.34,
          "end": 186.39,
          "en": "this page.js file, which is placed next to the layout",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 59,
          "start": 186.39,
          "end": 188.94,
          "en": "that will output the parallel routes,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 60,
          "start": 188.94,
          "end": 192.15,
          "en": "will be made available through the default children prop.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 61,
          "start": 192.15,
          "end": 194.64,
          "en": "So we can use that as an alternative",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 62,
          "start": 194.64,
          "end": 198.453,
          "en": "instead of creating a dedicated parallel route sub folder.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 63,
          "start": 199.32,
          "end": 202.8,
          "en": "But I will create such a parallel route sub folder",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 64,
          "start": 202.8,
          "end": 204.78,
          "en": "for the intercepted route.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 65,
          "start": 204.78,
          "end": 207.513,
          "en": "So that goes into the @modal folder.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 66,
          "start": 209.79,
          "end": 213.06,
          "en": "Now this path description",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 67,
          "start": 213.06,
          "end": 218.04,
          "en": "in the intercepting route folder name does not change.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 68,
          "start": 218.04,
          "end": 220.56,
          "en": "It does not change to two dots,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 69,
          "start": 220.56,
          "end": 223.89,
          "en": "even though we did now move it into some sub folder",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 70,
          "start": 223.89,
          "end": 228.72,
          "en": "because those parallel route folders are ignored",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 71,
          "start": 228.72,
          "end": 231.15,
          "en": "because this path you describe here",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 72,
          "start": 231.15,
          "end": 235.5,
          "en": "is actually not a path in your folder system,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 73,
          "start": 235.5,
          "end": 239.7,
          "en": "but instead in the URL path that will be rendered",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 74,
          "start": 239.7,
          "end": 242.4,
          "en": "because of your folder structure.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 75,
          "start": 242.4,
          "end": 244.89,
          "en": "And these parallel route folders",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 76,
          "start": 244.89,
          "end": 249.6,
          "en": "like @modal, or earlier @archive, and @latest",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 77,
          "start": 249.6,
          "end": 252.72,
          "en": "don't add anything to the URL.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 78,
          "start": 252.72,
          "end": 255,
          "en": "They're just there to organize the files",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 79,
          "start": 255,
          "end": 258.09,
          "en": "in a certain way NextJS expects.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 80,
          "start": 258.09,
          "end": 260.25,
          "en": "But since it's the URL path,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 81,
          "start": 260.25,
          "end": 262.86,
          "en": "that must be taken care of",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 82,
          "start": 262.86,
          "end": 265.2,
          "en": "in the intercepting route folder name,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 83,
          "start": 265.2,
          "end": 267.12,
          "en": "we don't have to change that name",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 84,
          "start": 267.12,
          "end": 270.75,
          "en": "if we move it into such a parallel route folder.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 85,
          "start": 270.75,
          "end": 272.22,
          "en": "Can be a bit confusing,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 86,
          "start": 272.22,
          "end": 276.213,
          "en": "but is something specific to this exact use case here.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 87,
          "start": 277.26,
          "end": 278.79,
          "en": "So now the intercepting route",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 88,
          "start": 278.79,
          "end": 282.39,
          "en": "is in that modal parallel route folder.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 89,
          "start": 282.39,
          "end": 284.43,
          "en": "And the advantage of this setup",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 90,
          "start": 284.43,
          "end": 287.97,
          "en": "is now that in the parent layout.js file,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 91,
          "start": 287.97,
          "end": 291,
          "en": "which sits above that @modal folder,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 92,
          "start": 291,
          "end": 293.43,
          "en": "we now don't just get the children prop,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 93,
          "start": 293.43,
          "end": 295.95,
          "en": "but also that modal prop,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 94,
          "start": 295.95,
          "end": 300.033,
          "en": "modal because I chose modal as an identifier here.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 95,
          "start": 301.23,
          "end": 304.14,
          "en": "And, therefore, we can now output that",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 96,
          "start": 304.14,
          "end": 306.963,
          "en": "maybe here above the children content.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 97,
          "start": 308.46,
          "end": 311.07,
          "en": "So therefore now we have that modal page content,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 98,
          "start": 311.07,
          "end": 312.63,
          "en": "which is output on the screen,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 99,
          "start": 312.63,
          "end": 316.77,
          "en": "and then that page content, the detailed page content here,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 100,
          "start": 316.77,
          "end": 319.38,
          "en": "which is made available through children.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 101,
          "start": 319.38,
          "end": 321.57,
          "en": "Now, the only problem we'll have",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 102,
          "start": 321.57,
          "end": 324.54,
          "en": "is that this modal parallel route",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 103,
          "start": 324.54,
          "end": 326.67,
          "en": "actually only outputs something",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 104,
          "start": 326.67,
          "end": 330.33,
          "en": "if we intercept this nested image path,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 105,
          "start": 330.33,
          "end": 332.97,
          "en": "then we want open that modal.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 106,
          "start": 332.97,
          "end": 335.31,
          "en": "But if we are just on /news",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 107,
          "start": 335.31,
          "end": 337.62,
          "en": "and then slash some slug,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 108,
          "start": 337.62,
          "end": 339.65999999999997,
          "en": "we actually don't output anything",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 109,
          "start": 339.65999999999997,
          "end": 341.853,
          "en": "from that modal parallel route.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 110,
          "start": 342.75,
          "end": 346.05,
          "en": "And for that reason, if you reload",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 111,
          "start": 346.05,
          "end": 349.08,
          "en": "and you go to that detail page,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 112,
          "start": 349.08,
          "end": 351.093,
          "en": "you'll get an error here.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 113,
          "start": 351.93,
          "end": 354.72,
          "en": "And therefore what you should do",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 114,
          "start": 354.72,
          "end": 356.58,
          "en": "to make this pattern work",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 115,
          "start": 356.58,
          "end": 360.21,
          "en": "is a default JS file",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 116,
          "start": 360.21,
          "end": 362.1,
          "en": "or a page.js file,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 117,
          "start": 362.1,
          "end": 364.5,
          "en": "doesn't matter here, inside of @modal,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 118,
          "start": 364.5,
          "end": 367.2,
          "en": "but outside of the intercepted route there.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 119,
          "start": 367.2,
          "end": 371.13,
          "en": "And then here, simply export a component function",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 120,
          "start": 371.13,
          "end": 373.84,
          "en": "that could be named ModalDefaultPage,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 121,
          "start": 375.66,
          "end": 377.76,
          "en": "and there simply return null",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 122,
          "start": 377.76,
          "end": 380.79,
          "en": "so that no visible content will be rendered",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 123,
          "start": 380.79,
          "end": 382.8,
          "en": "for this parallel route",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 124,
          "start": 382.8,
          "end": 386.28,
          "en": "when you are on the details page of a news article.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 125,
          "start": 386.28,
          "end": 389.88,
          "en": "But that we at least return something",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 126,
          "start": 389.88,
          "end": 394.05,
          "en": "so that NextJS knows that it doesn't have to render anything",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 127,
          "start": 394.05,
          "end": 396,
          "en": "instead of simply seeing",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 128,
          "start": 396,
          "end": 399.45,
          "en": "that you don't have any component at all for that path,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 129,
          "start": 399.45,
          "end": 400.923,
          "en": "which would not be good.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 130,
          "start": 402,
          "end": 405.3,
          "en": "And therefore, now with all those changes made,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 131,
          "start": 405.3,
          "end": 408,
          "en": "if you go back to such a details page",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 132,
          "start": 408,
          "end": 409.86,
          "en": "of one of these articles,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 133,
          "start": 409.86,
          "end": 411.9,
          "en": "and you click on this image,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 134,
          "start": 411.9,
          "end": 414.45,
          "en": "it's now opened as such an overlay,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 135,
          "start": 414.45,
          "end": 415.62,
          "en": "and you can see",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 136,
